  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "The Fresh Connection presents MAC 31, a premium 1g pre-roll crafted for cannabis enthusiasts seeking convenient, ready-to-enjoy experiences. This expertly rolled preroll showcases the celebrated MAC (Miracle Alien Cookies) genetics, known for delivering a balanced, euphoric high that uplifts the mind while relaxing the body. Expect a rich, creamy flavor profile with hints of earthy spice and sweet citrus that dance across the palate with each smooth draw. The MAC 31 strain is cherished for promoting happy, focused, and creative effects—perfect for social gatherings, artistic endeavors, or simply unwinding after a long day. The Fresh Connection ensures quality and consistency in every roll, using carefully selected flower to deliver a satisfying burn and full-bodied experience from start to finish. Whether you're a seasoned connoisseur or exploring new strains, this 1g pre-roll offers the perfect introduction to MAC's legendary appeal without the hassle of grinding or rolling yourself.",
